{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/214801-is-there-a-specific-name-for-stigmatic-objects","id":214801,"title":"Is there a specific name for \"Stigmatic\" Objects?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-31T10:34:40-07:00","id":214801,"title":"Is there a specific name for \"Stigmatic\" Objects?","content":"Was wondering if there is a specific name for inanimate objects that have been affected by the God-Machine similar to how animals being <i>Cryptids</i> and Humans being <i>Stigmatics</i>? Are they just called Relics? or is there even a name at all for them? Understanding that Gadgets are specific to items that Demons install Embeds to, I was curious if there was a different term for the former. Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/237-dagcon-faraday","name":"Dagcon Faraday","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-31T18:00:26-07:00","id":215371,"title":"","content":"Could certainly be Bygones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-31T18:45:11-07:00","id":215408,"title":"","content":"From Flowers of Hell, Chapter Four, page 143, &quot;Finding and Using Unknown Gadgets&quot;:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Not all gadgets a demon may possess are made from scratch or traded with another demon. Popular belief holds that the only way to create a gadget is by a demon\u2019s force of will, but stories persist of gadgets found after searching through suborned Infrastructure. Most demons suppose the gadget is a remnant of a poor Unchained who lost his fight against the God-Machine, the item the only testament to the fallen demon\u2019s final resting place. Gadgets have been found in old boltholes belonging to long dead demons, and these would be no different. Yet, the number of unexplained gadgets found in Infrastructure indicates a different reason.<br /> <b>When certain objects are within the confines of Infrastructure but are not inherently a part of it, they can be mutated by the God-Machine\u2019s influence over time. Only Embedded gadgets are ever created in this way. Just like a demon installing an Embed, the proximity to the God-Machine causes the item to take on some properties of a nearby supernatural subroutine. The process happens over long periods of time and is quite random. Not all Infrastructures are guaranteed to produce a gadget, no matter how long they have been around.</b> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-31T20:46:33-07:00","id":215502,"title":"","content":"Anomaly<br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antikythera_mechanism\" target=\"_blank\">anthikyther</a><br /> exosync<br /> elipitony/ eliptonic item (acknowledgments to <a href=\"http://www.kenandrobintalkaboutstuff.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Ken and Robin Talk About Stuff</a>)<br /> Object of Mutual Interest (acknowledgements to the creators of Delta- Green)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T08:39:41-07:00","id":215900,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Ah, so its Gadgets all around. Good to hear. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Thanks to all replies, much appreciated.<br /> <br /> @Agentwestmer: I </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">definitely </span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">do remember the <i>Antikythera Mechanism</i> was mentioned in the Reliquary supplement. Thanks again for bringing that one up!</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/237-dagcon-faraday","name":"Dagcon Faraday","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}